{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1235,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:176e4d9fcfaf90dab7744893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…勝負になればいいが。",
      "source_fingerprint": "629352f2fa5839f4d00d47d6b64ab5f9a2072f1f39aaa5184d2596413a0a6916",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d83afb90ee19ef7d15cad4a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "面白い、もっと力を見せてみろ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed805094e1b42430ad50060834ae19bbf4204da87580064f443fbb1f97b32a17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8f38f2ee605262de9407b9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……早上了。\r\n我不希望浪费任何一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82246d76470400bf83cd44722cc308ceee98cb65602db17c70340c654c71a058",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f2944ec86d6755aa6fedab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨的空气感觉很不错。\r\n宁静……就是这种感觉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eec3e358f6510de5158bae3d9eb0dd725d10e7884621c7a0e0e31997594a6a83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:421b06199324f31a316a49fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……下午了。\r\n赶快来开始训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c26289e4e985714f562a248c786796539b23250d83bdddff189dc81af5a4acd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcc57d59090bb7396500688",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午餐我都会在校舍后方吃。\r\n……只要能够忽略脚步声，\r\n其实就还满舒适的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8e6d86b2a5ae95cc491e464c598949bd98e33f028bd39470e0e9ebe11f96b85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee3d13388c131a18131e627c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太阳下山了，要进入黑暗了……\r\n这是自然界里最充满危险的时段。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aef13869dfbc170cc60b30cfd462cf082b72549501bec027dfa8a5018298476d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e8d4f9338b4695bbeb465c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乌鸦啼叫时就是该回家的时候……\r\n以前常听人这么说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d0b775b216ce118741f97dec1c1c4af4cddb07076f4720f627f63d5219c093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74097f5a80cc9dca243f374b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎多了很多新生吧。\r\n会是展翅高飞还是坠落地面……\r\n都要看雏鸟本身的努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "252c8498a327e96ad27f719c922639f83564c4a5ca60798366590ac993120960",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7aec1dad9f7ea4ae616fcc53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是蝉蜕啊。我小时候经常收集这个，\r\n都会跟大姐比谁的数量多……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2413a385258d132660dfbf49b1e4c4227c6bdce4607d17b66cd067f6efd42402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1404c3dee97b99327bcfe0fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虫鸣、风声──\r\n……就像是输家的哭声一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6349fb3772c6b6558cd033b48fb3a866d6d494931160ef84a9922789bade53c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62cb2f51b9f881f4c007433",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒冷是阻挡不了我的。\r\n──只要奔跑，我就会热血沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d2c6ebc6cba0241c553b3b28b1d2aff210abc18fd58be1a472234ad3db8b63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efc2d7a6ae4fc7ff83ddb187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天起得太早，就一路练跑，\r\n跑到隔壁镇……呵，回过神来才发现\r\n身边跟着一个意志力十足的家伙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dce542fa9d92235c455dea264f3a0df85126156b879e7d19904f30fc30ff9732",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42d3cb069b087a96dbb0b109",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看起来很困呢，去用冷水洗脸后\r\n拿粗盐搓完身体再来吧。\r\n这样做即使不情愿也会清醒的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87538054c94cb91090560f0e9e60da0fd077d28e4cec95d93caaf43b02786571",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed844ca9dc36c6af2bcf3813",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "记得好好填饱肚子。\r\n下午还要活动身体对吧？\r\n即使没食欲也得吃。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a6c9e83f3d9bfd329075cf5b353bf8dd5acce62c9a592a7191e63d3e586142b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:182bbc4d88a86365f54bc4fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道听课获得的知识很重要，\r\n但那些对凭借着冲动\r\n奔跑的我来说实在是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dffc10d677ca7923d96ce55fd2115e7058dbfbcd1d3bf1809d2baeaf5b43d1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d2781031336d2121c85793",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宁静的夜晚感官也会特别敏锐。\r\n正是练跑的最佳时机。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e84d18d237abde219b84437f4d0fbd11ca4bc2fcebc118e6a21fac4e4793dc43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:363006b53136144af2662855",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这么晚了你还在工作啊……\r\n真巧，我也是，即使时间不早了，\r\n仍因为想跑步而情绪高涨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea4f89bcdac8ee643509f77bac2b8576e6e6c215bbb93f9a24562e8c239adb07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76f9e2b2c66a54c5c2c9edd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还在想跑步时怎么这么多人\r\n在一边看……原来是新生啊。\r\n未来她们可能会成为我的对手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f22401082b6ed92ad544fe100fb109d0943cd9deede917891c7ed63ae2c2ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8504e7a338b314c44925c7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天有集训，\r\n是适合锻炼的好时机。\r\n可别让我做些普普通通的训练啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e35c48dd3a6ba3903bb70e031449b7b0b244cc861e36b46480fe71e73f82da8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f691143f72c14e408374583f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近天气转凉了不少，\r\n但内心反而变得更加炙热……\r\n真期待秋天的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e346294e191ca891447ba95dc678d94c0de65ea744b2484a934be47cd2175c91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08ef1bebc09eea88a1667405",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可没时间冬眠。\r\n身为野兽，就是应该\r\n主动出击去狩猎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bfc4251906b969fc275d48f860ffba5038ebe958a7a8063d66ccf8edc65dba0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6efbc1c8b7a8aee66fb2987d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7e11dcf7d36399b15d230c810a93a48bd78c089bc62a3db49804ea1160b8b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2aec30d25441cb7a3219785",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节……快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b7e11dcf7d36399b15d230c810a93a48bd78c089bc62a3db49804ea1160b8b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a1ffcce700e67cff376b55e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我脸上的胶布？\r\n因为贴着就能提升专注力。\r\n也想不起来是从什么时候开始的了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2ded6ee91f29b8dffa1fd4f24090e35c3289a54c6c1aa09b452e88542d40d75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61502039eeb80232338249ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戴着黑色发饰的后辈经常来挑衅……\r\n虽然现在是一副爱说大话的感觉，\r\n但说不定──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dcbe7a37bf3f8cab779d0e0410d4051e150dbe50cbea47b622665dce76278b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2cabf21afdbe32894f3e5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐老是问我「有没有好好吃饭？\r\n有没有好好睡觉？」什么的。\r\n……还是跟以前一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e9f160fb8bf0b043705d4f4f78285920353d0b8a77dc218fc4cd447a25a26e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95dd39ef787b91e131559736",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "猛禽类的爪子和鸟喙……\r\n那甚至会不小心伤到自己的锐利，\r\n莫名地吸引我……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc43a45a5cbd96c93b56bcb933f448c730d0e5a01782e0789c004fb681497641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:985e9821ab55918c8a304c48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "藏在「皇帝」品格背后的……\r\n究竟是些什么？\r\n总有一天我一定会揭穿的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08fcb44c99fb8c8be7fc4c01664f13c9f3428f4b5468e727d584a95dc8bbe5a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:316c60ef1e1ebc94e59b7ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是过于花俏的衣服……\r\n喂，这袖子我可以拆掉吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f616c8dbd908478a9f834fe0a463c88a42e5ba51a5d0c0ff691262f667c3bcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0498a36c6c08a3a5a764b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重要的是能否站上赢家的舞台。\r\n……我对舞台上的表演没有兴趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6275d5eab207292a78cabf6bced9cda85ce4f2fb0877633f8ea3fc7df3c43e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31bd11cab3e08add92a2874d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服原本袖子很长。\r\n因为很碍事，我就把它给拆了。\r\n……你干嘛这个脸？",
      "source_fingerprint": "730b2f63b9f65aba40219cd6288c6fa71038d9d30cc9a4ea88ca12b025a542fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5855cfe1f103d6179165c080",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获胜的时候周围都会特别吵闹……\r\n要是能因为这样，\r\n吸引强者来到我身边的话就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5724fc9c56503af3fa549998b7081087debc4b3202b4bafb9276df66fff0f8cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b8934d368ac0e41a786744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上太晚出门是很致命的。特别是\r\n宿舍的餐厅，乱到我受不了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "81b2b89bb21ae8c4b4330bff2bc192b07463258d11e5bb1aada3ba5f53f82348",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908f1772737494bbb09c030c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……亚马逊同学又做便当给我了。\r\n虽然味道是不错，\r\n就是偶尔会是造型便当这点……",
      "source_fingerprint": "14e1dc05a961dc9cfddb52cae5a9e5b46a140923a12537e731d36fc29de9d5d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:568ce3f2939e3cadb489c75c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "睡不着就去跑到精疲力尽。\r\n通常这么做，\r\n几乎都会在不知不觉中失去意识。",
      "source_fingerprint": "126d82fe47d0af0c76a8e38743f7317a8cad07cb3cbc4e1105adf4f73d30b36b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb668d3e524d98dcd47eb4f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气开始变暖了。\r\n可以开始穿短袖──不，无袖也行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ed84e17786077c337a25eff720647e6233c81af94622b31ec95301b0af41c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a94401dd9a6e817b9ca2451c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气热特别消耗体力……\r\n去吃点肉来补充营养好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3fd2acd53448e7233e189edef760484abcf17e967ab2c9679c4ff6c93df5cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4acc2c7bbd458318d87187f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凋落的红叶给人一种哀伤感。\r\n现在──还不到我凋零的时候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb826dec3bcb1ee67a01a2ee955765fef046573d2c440c6c56e46b55fe6b8b89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17580976028d78f31d970521",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暖炉桌吗……\r\n我有时候也会抵挡不住诱惑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c6015fdb3aa55a091c168cad6d631cd347854ed5baa4ea044b35f0249519f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:378a3852d0728f18a0ceab06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桂冠啊……真是个怪人。\r\n潜藏在那笑容背后的尖牙……呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c39c4c8ac92bb9821f06e9d06d328c72a9e3245589e3db1d0d2bc06ebd1afa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e08cdaf6ccc54c9bb584134",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美酒……虽然我们每天都在同一间\r\n寝室生活，但她到底在说什么……\r\n我实在是搞不懂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "821a2661b2b3cf321e3db0e8ad2765b892be3f7d02296d0df7c4ad7a0e9e355b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:740349c78b9b6c5e88ac4d9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮对这套服装赞不绝口……\r\n虽然我不太懂，但她说\r\n就像音速战斗机一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4988142ca76c6dc78d0037f2b4ceeb3677375790eaa7849671a928fece8a4a83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0442c4ead45932a8aea5526b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫垂着尾巴听气槽说教……\r\n只要不被波及，\r\n那场面实在是很有趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7848e5e0a6c4c3c23dab58279adf99c1889445950167072776beea58e72ee36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d871203d12a60b5c8bba32a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大姐刚开始戴眼镜时，\r\n我因为新奇曾经偷偷拿来戴过……\r\n但一戴上就头晕了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e74a0ac5029b7c7d2457e83d4405dbcdc79fb8f3bf1a2bc4c675dc02dbbfd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aecc86cf89690ed9916efb45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正要吃饭时，发现桌上\r\n放着一杯果菜汁……\r\n大姐那家伙，竟然多管闲事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ae6287c224934ee6a4151f3e381626364f3e04ea589524d92d2ac85d79f3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:055c970972fad32dd6751dee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会吃肉以外的食物，\r\n但都不如吃肉能补充力气，\r\n所以我选择吃肉。有意见吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f80b488d21eb73bf967a9fa4fdb3cac81f527a1a2fddf89c8db214ac562d1019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df6342f2de4eb5f96a03078e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来晚上练耐力跑这么舒畅啊。\r\n要是早点知道就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "117e13113c0c9d0792689dc9b7900eb75ef0dcbe3403583fdb6d42c7c02b96fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b623af95f3aa2e04b642cdee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "亚马约我去赏花。我们一起吃了\r\n两个四层便当……美味是美味，\r\n但她也做太多料理了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2d10bde7976c62b8fdb60209d666f785e7e5a7f6b8c745676482b3d8c88c44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a863ae3eb9a9c4020a87459",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我家，麦茶是夏天的必备饮料。\r\n我负责喝光，大姐负责泡。\r\n……偶尔也会换我泡喔。只是偶尔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "903d8de1b99145c182ebd2a8e8b22fd16152450b7083f9bf5e308713e78c0833",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:789dd0e645b2ff144626febc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "骏大祭的流镝马……真的很不错。\r\n在伸手不见五指的黑暗中，\r\n所有感官逐渐打开的感觉……呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d48915e47c3fee8295764fbe0e4857528bacd9fc43ae909c4bf1bb60dc29c9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e46c0b8971984119d9acaec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下雪的季节吗。\r\n我也曾经看着雪白的景色看到入迷，\r\n那毫无阴影、纯白无瑕的景色……",
      "source_fingerprint": "be5dc22d6d2c91f03ec307021e21b959f5577d7646d29788a9aaeb89bc6092d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:026e8ffa9146021059e9a79c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光与影、荣耀与挫折。\r\n体验过二者，仍然敢于挑战胜负──\r\n这套衣服，就象征着这样的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e4de044c1b73d1155de5aa86fa06eec2e3eb502b11310931e09b540af6b8f15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af7621d81a82e5b355f99b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这套服装宛如黑暗……\r\n但穿上它的我却感到斗志熊熊燃烧。\r\n化身夺走胜利的黑影──也不错。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5367040234801bbe32f7890e2e6c9b51c122e509e3a8db8762f4648f30fc2573",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d149f1fd00a10fe8f8bc035e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "取胜是需要实力的。\r\n……开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3db90d680877b257dbda6c9ed4802c876be94637071abb852c3875d55ade02b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f3506102b187b5061dbb77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くぞ……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40503d4efeaedddf3221ed890a8c38071d33db21f8ff9edfd07c8ce195434d6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a8f0ea203c4eae8e19a4e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我见识看看你的作法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ea0d243c74eff16f8a5f31415fc7e236b74216eb8c80d4fc79c9ff8ce73c76e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8e9bf0e7e7238d1288efd1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大意失荆州。\r\n……专心面对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b741fcb22d7dad9b794542eba01666d57f11fbc64af5b46ae4f76254158e1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfa0b6ec97f185f1a347ffc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的努力都是为了应战做准备……\r\n可没有时间浪费。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb42c2e1052427ca39c8d6236c8645f89582c2bb5571c2c7adc61219f046121b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3900d60cc59ed79369a2513d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在失去翅膀之前，鸟都会持续飞翔。\r\n只为飞得更高、更远……",
      "source_fingerprint": "572b1eaad1f0c3ba3795742629212fef1e224231a0ce013272171699c4d82217",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77abccf38ae710a6a0bb066d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得越强就会越看不到极限。\r\n……但现在我只需要专注全力冲刺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2176da2d4679c1cbc29d876eb45274d2b2ab72b971a899919ad505bf56a2db2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0257a58fdd386518a9d324ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能力越强大，欲望也会跟着膨胀……\r\n──赶快开始我们的训练吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47a297d6118a1d105d7ceb8e6fd0bc0fb15ee95dadfcec94a0d9a04340430392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7718791591da5b61b4f9ee71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……随便的锻炼是不可能\r\n在比赛中派上用场的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ab3a36bed0b9b408c97c5b6d1023f8f66a50f2cbf4fe24d6c04cebc947f222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aea945be219f0931f3ed517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。我早就准备好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13937ce0fb5828b9392ff572a35e519e68a487d2d991475ab9dd09dfa405908",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce5659520527037bd8a8acfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当我训练得越多，\r\n期待上场比赛的心情就越强烈。\r\n来吧，我还要变得更亢奋……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d737a3b6882eca563bed5f7b65ebd41a29df3b33260f3310718d81434a89e878",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaf221ed7e472b2fbae160a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用顾虑我。\r\n什么指示我都能达成。\r\n尽管来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81d5f5ecc7a488d1e1e6b9a5e33e4b91ba671197d446da6327c0013c1599acb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:526cca354303d063d2a19779",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我看到你放在桌上的\r\n那份训练项目了。\r\n……就照那样没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5909a08b229fd5e2a9d86cfccab5699cd0a74fdc5b75d924cca488ea3f05bdbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:935ad3b550cb7f0e22ebde56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怪物就该有怪物的样子，\r\n将一切啃食殆尽。为此，\r\n现在我得先将尖牙磨利……对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3165f412bd4a2184ec698399bb63a568d96b9fa873e02bde54459d77c68ced7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d023c4dab9446447fa99680",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热身时我尽量收敛了……毕竟\r\n我可不想糟蹋你安排的训练项目。\r\n那，我该做什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8be09634443cf9778851bc770428ace8ab8c3b752b1c256b2b2d334c573f2d37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5be60224ba0d3b7190c843b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到最后，对手们甚至连我的影子\r\n都踩不到……我会跑出像这样\r\n有着绝对差距的比赛给你看的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5db7d1d6c9cbe34b572bf0ac9c70961b143b19eeece3985390de148ef2d4fcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:914b9185ba333c532812b737",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我们现在的眼神都很不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2734b6def8e5d0ca3a8b26beb3cf144b61d379ebeae31fb1279dd23da35b300",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b0170d2306174a5c5fa773e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的欲望……稍微得到满足了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e19f80419d4fc4b6427ea8e6e81d25d725575d3ae501f08ba5c71dbec0b7355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72223f1096aa6293ecf9a255",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只说一次……今后也要跟上我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04732cdb9efba79aa2d378e64be3f3255209d90469c3867de4117c352cb7b1cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3cfd40cddb50b303f20b139",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的决心还不赖嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4825991ee90ff4dfab981662421de4ec5ae721da94569398de4a139e8a3aafa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6c3a5ad97682f5305595b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我需要……更强大的实力……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9c11a5426ffe671288ad3d11c5c01caf271f82fad5ff8c748afa4a93b945b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e90b65cea57cb8d851d863c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还要更好、再更好……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ae22bda14777360206984db03156536fbc88bb81ee7b16ab91677ba51e4553c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c306cd9561e9dc90f8671d33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……没错，我就是成田白仁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66cd913ef08dabd4cd2601ebb63e76ae689405e9c8a3b70bd9f30542ec8d6ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e77a0d04c0c617e6712182a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会继续奋斗──\r\n只要灵魂还在沸腾、\r\n内心还在吶喊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de1c082bcd9410db7e22a851416f39c1ef5ad4bc852e1776a20bde2a0bcf5170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa812d3418eae64cdad90d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我来帮你一把。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ea25a57ca1cc758459bef65da0df48cc90b4f8681f000fb23177a255f1c596",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87cf977d1b49fc05a040c026",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来让你超越极限……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c6646e561f162f849acba44debd33e8507c48251478cdebda76a0ea0b00d268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1016",
        "95006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
